The morning sun filters through the blinds. $mom.callName walks up to the bed in a skimpy white crop top and yellow panties, her toned midriff and long legs on display as she holds a steaming mug of coffee. The outfit was clearly rushed from her early routine. She sets the cup on the nightstand, gently shaking my shoulder to wake me, her blonde hair falling loosely around her face.

<<silently>>
